# Shape Law

**Principle:** Border radius and border width should use a consistent scale. Prefer 8pt grid for radius.

## Border Radius Scale

| Level | Value | Use Case |
|-------|-------|----------|
| sm | 8px | Buttons, inputs, small chips |
| md | 12px or 16px | Cards, panels |
| lg | 20px or 24px | Modals, large containers |
| full | 50% or 9999px | Pills, avatars |

**8pt-aligned:** 8px, 16px, 24px, 32px

**Avoid:** 12px, 20px if strict 8pt grid (use 8 or 16, 16 or 24 instead). Some design systems use 12/20 — document your choice.

## Border Width

- **Default:** 1px
- **Emphasis:** 2px
- **Avoid:** Fractional px (0.5px) — inconsistent across browsers

